SUMMARY:Moths From Nature
DESCRIPTION:Let’s make some moths!  In this virtual program\, we’ll learn about moth anatomy and some of their interesting characteristics before making our own moths from natural materials such as leaves and sticks.  Look for the list of things to bring to the program in the email confirmation you’ll receive upon registration! \nRegister
URL:https://www.naturalsciences.org/calendar/event/moths-from-nature/
LOCATION:Virtual\, NC\, United States
CATEGORIES:Children,Collaborative Science,ecoEXPLORE,K-12 Students,Teens,Virtual
ORGANIZER;CN="ecoEXPLORE%20Team":MAILTO:ecoexplore@naturalsciences.org
END:VEVENT
