SUMMARY:Butterfly Walk
DESCRIPTION:All programs at Prairie Ridge currently require registration. Register\nCurious about the butterflies in your backyard? Come learn how to distinguish different species and understand butterfly behaviors. After a brief talk\, we’ll explore the garden and prairie to see how many different butterflies we can find. We will learn how to contribute our observations at data to the collaborative science project eButterfly in this program for ages 18+.
URL:https://www.naturalsciences.org/calendar/event/butterfly-walk-8-2026/
LOCATION:Prairie Ridge\, 1671 Gold Star Drive\, Raleigh\, NC\, 27607\, United States
